{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom of Daanco is in danger! A great evil is preparing to launch a full-scale attack! When Saucey mysteriously finds himself within Daanco, he is forced into helping the King unite the people of Daanco! They must all work together to make a stand against those that threaten the peace. Embark on this adventure to help Saucey and friends save Daanco!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 vs 3 Turn-Based Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete button prompts during your attacks to deal more damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimate attacks with hand-drawn character cut-ins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items for extra buffs, healing, and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run away from enemies if you really want to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different party members with unique abilities and stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of unique enemies and bosses to fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret superbosses to discover</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic, silly, and fun main quest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new friends who join your party</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character specific side quests and post game quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Kingdom of Daanco on your adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious characters are causing trouble</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's deeper lore to uncover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden treasure boxes to find around Daanco</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game +</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames, like fishing! And... uhh... Grambling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... We still don't know what grambling is... But you can play it!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The SauceLore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2560730/2ddb8912183a30696386e71c884169fd2f42e923.jpg"},{"name":"See ya, Ethanetta!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2560730/ab7e0ae88236ff37acb7c5ca6e5ce1e657a6fb15.jpg"},{"name":"Rejoice in Tiramisu Eternal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2560730/e66f6472f36b00c948ef3ae6ea13dc8f9b50e052.jpg"},{"name":"Better Call Nina","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2560730/955aa061227824a2a837e40c377a351cfe1c604b.jpg"},{"name":"Dating a Goddess","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2560730/daac7a9594b437b92aacf14d616f0e38f2ec247a.jpg"},{"name":"Gromblins Grambled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2560730/7d2c62e11775a2f0cac0d2e73d1464ee35f5d794.jpg"},{"name":"The Greatest Grambler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2560730/f99244e8982668e7a9f73d6afa5cb842288b15f3.jpg"},{"name":"Daanco\u2019s Strongest Soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2560730/8dd33f3efa5dcf022a36361cc3b11e7cd437b824.jpg"},{"name":"Peace\u2019s Purpose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2560730/0b8e90a1f6f0097a0e5a2f54a9b0efb164086130.jpg"},{"name":"A Shadow of the True Self","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2560730/c6292fcd7ecb00a166ef412785e3cfa3efd33bd5.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2560730?t=1757721808","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it